      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Is that not so?　Did you get it for me?\r\n—I'll take it then.\r\nThank you.",
        "Jp" : "違う？　わたしのために用意してくれたの？\r\n――それじゃあ、もらっておくよ\r\nありがとう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819874,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "On this peculiar paper, \r\nthere are characters that look like drawings.\r\nIt's an unfamiliar style, \r\nbut it's a beautiful letter.\r\nI want to take good care of it \r\nand bring it back to Acre Selund.",
        "Jp" : "変わった紙に、絵みたいな文字\r\n見慣れない様式だけど――きれいな手紙だ\r\nこれ、アッカーシェランまで大事に\r\n持って帰りたいな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819875,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Lately, I've been feeling nervous because I've\r\nbeen constantly looking at the documents\r\nbrought by the messengers.",
        "Jp" : "ここのところ、伝令の持ってくる\r\n書類ばっかり見てたから\r\n何だか緊張するよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819876,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "- Um, hey, I know this is a strange question, but\r\nhow should I respond to this kind of gift?\r\nEverything is so unfamiliar and sudden...",
        "Jp" : "――あのさ、変なこと聞くけど\r\nこういう贈り物ってどう返事したらいい？\r\n突然慣れないことばっかりで――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 819905,
